<title>POLAND: Budimex stays flat despite contract.</title>
<headline>Budimex stays flat despite contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Budimex SA stayed flat at 25 zlotys in 5.8-million zloty trade despite winning a 188.2-million-zloty contract last week.</p>
<p>On Monday Budimex rose 4.2 percent and traders expected it to extend gains.</p>
<p>&quot;The small scale of the growth is really surprising after winning such a huge contract. Perhaps someone wanted to get rid of the stock anyway,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Budimex won a tender for building a part of a sewage treatment plant in Gdansk, northern Poland.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
